{"symbol":"DXC","area":"sp500","updated":"2026-11-09T18:56:27Z","info":{"address1":"20408 Bashan Drive","address2":"Suite 231","city":"Ashburn","state":"VA","zip":"20147","country":"United States","phone":"703-972-9700","website":"https://dxc.com","industry":"Information Technology Services","industryKey":"information-technology-services","industryDisp":"Information Technology Services","sector":"Technology","sectorKey":"technology","sectorDisp":"Technology","longBusinessSummary":"DXC Technology Company, together with its subsidiaries, provides information technology services and solutions in the United States, the United Kingdom, the Rest of Europe, Australia, and internationally. It operates through three segments: Consulting & Engineering Services, Global Infrastructure Services, and Insurance Software & Services. The Consulting & Engineering Services segment delivers software engineering, consulting, and custom and enterprise application solutions; focusing on AI and data analytics to enhance operations and support digital transformation across industries such as finance, automotive, manufacturing, healthcare, life sciences, travel, and the public sector. The Global Infrastructure Services segment provides design, migration, and management of data center, mainframe, cloud, and network environments. This segment also provides cross-industry business process services, which streamline clients' core enterprise functions such as finance, HR, procurement, and customer service. The Insurance Software & Services segment offers software and business process services for life and wealth, property and casualty, and reinsurance providers to modernize and digitally transform their operations. The company markets and sells its products through a direct sales force to commercial businesses and public sector enterprises. DXC Technology Company has a multi-year global alliance with Anthropic to bring AI into mission-critical enterprise systems; and strategic partnership with ElevenLabs to accelerate AI-first transformation strategy by embedding advanced voice AI capabilities across its internal operations and customer solutions. DXC Technology Company was founded in 1959 and is headquartered in Ashburn, Virginia.","fullTimeEmployees":115000,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Raul J. Fernandez","age":58,"title":"CEO & Director","yearBorn":1967,"fiscalYear":2026,"totalPay":5388678,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Robert F. Del Bene","age":66,"title":"Chief Financial Officer","yearBorn":1959,"fiscalYear":2026,"totalPay":1644837,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Matthew K. Fawcett J.D.","age":57,"title":"Chief Legal Officer","yearBorn":1968,"fiscalYear":2026,"totalPay":1257600,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Raymond Alexander August CPA","age":63,"title":"President of Insurance Software & Business Process Services","yearBorn":1962,"fiscalYear":2026,"totalPay":1283989,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Paul  Taylor","title":"President","fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Christopher Anthony Voci","age":52,"title":"Controller & Principal Accounting Officer","yearBorn":1973,"fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Anthony  Pappas","title":"Chief Marketing Officer","fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Jennifer  Ragone","age":53,"title":"Executive VP & Chief People Officer","yearBorn":1972,"fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Marian  Kelley","title":"Head of Industry Marketing","fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Luz G. Mauch","title":"Executive Vice President of Automotive","fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"auditRisk":1,"boardRisk":2,"compensationRisk":10,"shareHol